[2] RAW-DISPLACEMENT SANITY (delta_x = 1/2 * a * t^2 / absorption):
    arc   10 yr, fit-A Mars absorption   : residual displacement =    14.30 m
    arc   10 yr, kitchen-sink Mars       : residual displacement =    10.16 m
    arc   10 yr, kitchen-sink Saturn     : residual displacement =     0.66 m
